      },
      {
        "title": "Marinade ingredients",
        "summary": "Building a basic stir-fry marinade of soy sauce, salt, Shaoxing wine, an alkaline element (egg white in place of baking soda), cornstarch and oil, with the role of each.",
        "first_segment": 3,
